を検証してから判断します）。</div><div class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"68.4\" width=\"320\" height=\"28.799999999999997\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,57.2 9.1,45.0 14.2,50.8 19.3,59.7 24.5,48.9 29.6,51.0 34.7,74.2 39.8,58.9 44.9,64.5 50.0,74.4 55.1,75.1 60.3,73.4 65.4,68.0 70.5,62.6 75.6,60.1 80.7,59.1 85.8,62.0 91.0,70.1 96.1,61.2 101.2,32.3 106.3,17.6 111.4,14.9 116.5,12.8 121.6,15.7 126.8,20.7 131.9,25.1 137.0,30.1 142.1,31.5 147.2,27.0 152.3,17.6 157.4,16.6 162.6,16.8 167.7,31.3 172.8,28.0 177.9,24.0 183.0,31.5 188.1,44.4 193.2,50.8 198.4,54.3 203.5,47.1 208.6,31.1 213.7,45.4 218.8,42.3 223.9,32.5 229.0,39.8 234.2,42.5 239.3,43.7 244.4,42.9 249.5,31.7 254.6,57.0 259.7,48.5 264.9,42.7 270.0,35.9 275.1,32.3 280.2,35.2 285.3,42.1 290.4,44.8 295.5,37.9 300.7,53.3 305.8,66.8 310.9,69.1 316.0,62.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 69.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 69.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 69.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 69.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 69.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 69.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 19.3 71.7 